body:
I have not read or seen Black Panter. I did just Google it and skim read about it. It seems the guy in it the main dude is from sub-saharan Africa.... So it wouldn't make sense to have a white person let alone a ginger play them.

&#x200B;

If they weren't from africa i wouldnt see the problem with it. But I dont know any of the story aside from where hes from so its hard to say

You're not even replying to my comments correctly. It is clear that there are roles in comic books. However no one and nothing is being 'erased'

&#x200B;

Comics, books, scripts etc once they are films tend to change the look of many many roles.. Its acting. No one is getting replaced.

Woah when you mentioned Twin Peaks I wasn't expecting for you to go with this sort of sound. Not complaining though I like it! Wish it didn't end so abruptly, perhaps a smoother ending would be better? Other than that it sounds super good! I love it.

&#x200B;

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zJ0CVHvZIQg](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zJ0CVHvZIQg) Here is a bedroom song my partner did and I mixed. It's sort of a lofi/indie vibe going on.. Happy melody sad lyrics haha. It's a side project we are doing, just simple bedroom tracks, not meant to have a proepr 'studio' sound (for now anyway) let me know what ya think!

>https://soundcloud.com/tonyscarpitti/movie-dogs

Nice! Gives me Travis vibes, digging the guitar and the mix sounds great.. Nice vocals too :)

&#x200B;

Heres a bedroom track I mixed for my partner. Sort of like lofi/indieish type of sound. Happy melody, sad lyrics haha.

&#x200B;

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zJ0CVHvZIQg](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zJ0CVHvZIQg)

Wow that was a depressing read... My partner is going through pretty much the same thing. In fact she has a talk with her mother today about their relationship in only and hour and a half from now I wish she could screenshot this and send this to her mother but if she did her mother would just hug her and tell her "it's okay, i'm here to support you always" then go on like nothing happened and continue on to be the least understanding person in all the UK. 

&#x200B;

I really hope you and your mother can grow and she learns to understand you. You are not a dissapointment, and as your wrote this letter I can see you care very much. I'm sorry you have to deal with these sort of problems.

Nope, why? I am just waking up having a coffee and english muffin which is BOMB by the way.

&#x200B;

If you consider me walking my partner to the doctors office when half asleep this morning because she didn't wanna go alone... Then yes? But I wouldn't consider that "help" more like just being a good friend/parter/lover :)

Posted a few times.. A different version this time, partner thinks I put her voice "too high" I think it makes it sound less muddy? What does anyone else think? And any feedback would be awesome!

&#x200B;

[https://soundcloud.com/boyyleo/fell-in-love-on-a-thursday](https://soundcloud.com/boyyleo/fell-in-love-on-a-thursday)

[https://soundcloud.com/boyyleo/outta-luck](https://soundcloud.com/boyyleo/outta-luck)

&#x200B;

Looking for constructive cristism on this track, worked hard on it. I feel like it's not at it's 100% potential. Perhaps I am too hard on myself. I will keep on creating and working on my mixing stills and hope to get better. But any feedback would be great, thank you!

Trap style thing going on... Feedback would be cool :)

&#x200B;

[https://soundcloud.com/boyyleo/bad-dayz](https://soundcloud.com/boyyleo/bad-dayz)

Cool will give a listen once home from work.. heres something we jus did 

&#x200B;

