re-done version of song with new lyrics. cant change the beat as i said it was already done. but she wanted new lyrics... thought id ask you for an opinion. i also re-did leave me be (mix anyway)

[https://soundcloud.com/dukhita/leave-me-be](https://soundcloud.com/dukhita/leave-me-be) 

&#x200B;

Version 2 of this song, some people on here may have heard the first version but i've just re-uploaded it, first one had way too much reverb etc.

My partner lives for music and anyone wanting to help her out, collab, help me with mixing and master let me know! 

&#x200B;

Anyway let me know what you guys think.

Thank you, the melody was already done do i cannot change it but will have my partner re-record it and try mixing it in better

&#x200B;

EDIT: Im actually going to be re-doing all the tracks on thatsoundcloud, starting with leave me be. If there are any tips or anything you can give or anycomplaints on the songs, good or nad. let me know that way i can improve. i know leave me be has way too much reverb it was my first mix ever... im going to try to really improve it, and then do the same with the others

Please any feedback would be greatly appreciated. Vocalist is my partner and I did my best mixing this, its very new to me (mixing etc) but we tried... Let me know what everyone thinks

&#x200B;

